  "audit_season": 2021,
  "test_season": 2022,
  "selection_rule": "Minimum unweighted mean seasonal outcome log loss on 2019 and 2020 only; all four predeclared candidates reported on audit/test, with no subsequent retuning.",
  "preprocessing": "Fold-only median imputation and missing indicators, team encoding; Poisson alpha=0.01 with scaled numeric features; RF depth=5, max_features=0.3, max_samples=0.5. Independent Poisson conversion to home/draw/away probabilities.",
  "position_rule": "First listed FIFA preferred position; one unit per player. LW/RW attack, LM/RM/CAM/CDM midfield, LWB/RWB defense. Not observed match-day positions.",
  "missing_rule": "Means need >=8 accepted starters per side, >=1 attacker/goalkeeper or >=2 midfielders/defenders with valid ratings. Counts retained. Missing values never zero-filled before subtraction; model imputation uses training folds only. Partial units are estimates.",
  "caveat": "Season-edition FIFA files have no verified publication timestamps. This inherits the historical pipeline snapshot limitation and is an exploratory experiment, not a strict as-of live backtest. No named EPL lineups or pre-2014 subratings used. Audit and test seasons have been inspected previously.",
